=== Refinement Comparison Engine Sample ===
--- [eq-implies-relational] ---
  == 7 implies >= 0: nn = 7
  == 7 implies <= 10: amt = 7
  == 7 implies > 5: gtf = 7
  == 7 implies < 10: ltt = 7
--- [eq-identity] ---
  == 7 implies == 7: ae7 = 7
--- [not-identity] ---
  not 7 implies not 7: ans = 42
--- [eq-implies-not] ---
  == 5 implies not 7: ns2 = 5
--- [relational-implies-not] ---
  > 5 implies not 5: nf1 = 10
  < 5 implies not 5: nf2 = 2
--- [cross-operator] ---
  >= 10 implies > 5: gtf2 = 10
  > 5 implies > 5: gtf4 = 8
--- [or-membership] ---
  == 7 implies (7 or 8): soe = 7
--- [or-subset] ---
  (7 or 8) implies (7 or 8 or 9): soen = 7
--- [or-implies-relational] ---
  (7 or 8) implies >= 7: gts = 8
  (7 or 8) implies <= 8: lte = 8
--- [or-implies-not] ---
  (7 or 8) implies not 5: nf3 = 7
--- [compound-mixed] ---
  (> 0 and < 50) implies (>= 0 and <= 100): zth = 25
--- [multi-numeric] ---
  short == 3 implies short >= 0: nns2 = 3
  byte == 10 implies byte <= 50: amfb = 10
=== Refinement Comparison Engine Done ===
